{
  "Answer": {
    "Title": "Tag filters must be added to every job in the workflow",
    "Explanation": [
      "The frozen workflow run shows all three jobs (build, test, deploy) finishing SUCCESS, so the pipeline is green — but green only because this run was triggered by an API/branch trigger, not a tag. In CircleCI 2.1, workflow jobs implicitly filter to branches only: unless a job has an explicit `filters: tags:` stanza, it will never run for a tag push. Therefore, with the frozen config: (a) pushing a beta tag runs nothing at all — deploy never fires for the required beta-tagged release flow, and (b) deploy currently fires on every ordinary branch commit, which is the opposite of the stated requirement that only beta-pattern tags trigger deployment. So the observed behaviour does not satisfy the requirement.",
      "",
      "The affected scope is the whole `build-test-and-deploy` workflow, not just the deploy job: `requires` does not propagate tag filters. If only deploy carried a tag filter, its upstream dependencies build and test would still be branch-only, would not run on a tag, and deploy would consequently never be scheduled in the tagged flow. Every job in the dependency chain that must participate in the tagged flow needs its own `filters` block with a `tags` key.",
      "",
      "The required configuration is to add tag filters restricted to the beta product pattern (e.g. `filters: { tags: { only: /^beta.*/ } }`) to all jobs in the workflow, so that build, test and deploy all participate in the beta-tag flow while non-beta tags are excluded from triggering the deployment. Relying on `requires`, filtering only the deploy job, allowing all tags, or moving filters into the job definition would all fail to produce the required behaviour."
    ],
    "ActualAnswer": [
      "{",
      "  \"behaviour_correct\": false,",
      "  \"fix\": \"filters_tags_only_beta\",",
      "  \"fix_target_job\": \"all_jobs\",",
      "  \"pipeline_green\": true",
      "}"
    ],
    "ExpectedAnswer": [
      [
        "{",
        "  \"behaviour_correct\": false,",
        "  \"fix\": \"filters_tags_only_beta\",",
        "  \"fix_target_job\": \"all_jobs\",",
        "  \"pipeline_green\": true",
        "}"
      ]
    ],
